; DT818_pro_v2.1 - 6-stream ORB rank portfolio (no hedge), 9.0% total per setup
; Generated 2026-05-16. Range filter disabled (per WFO 2026-05-13 Option A).
;
; ROTATION 2026-05-16:
;   S1/S2/S3: PREVIOUS-week WFO top 3 (wfo_orb_may9, ran 2026-05-16)
;   S4/S5/S6: CURRENT-week  WFO top 3 (wfo_orb_may16, ran 2026-05-16)
;
; DUPLICATE-SKIP POLICY (user pref 2026-05-16):
;   MAY16 rank #1 (SL=550/RR=3.5/HTP=0.2) duplicated MAY9 rank #2 -> SKIPPED
;   MAY16 rank #5 (SL=700/RR=2.5/HTP=0.4) duplicated MAY9 rank #1 -> SKIPPED
;   S4/S5/S6 use MAY16 ranks #2, #3, #4 (next distinct picks).
;
; PREVIOUS week (wfo_orb_may9, 60pt friction, 6% risk WFO):
;   S1 rank 1: Range=90/SL=700/RR=2.5/HTP=0.4   P0=PASS slope=+17.3%  NP/DD=+1593
;   S2 rank 2: Range=90/SL=550/RR=3.5/HTP=0.2   P0=PASS slope=-15.6%  NP/DD=+1398
;   S3 rank 3: Range=90/SL=400/RR=4.0/HTP=0.6   P0=FAIL slope=-73.0%  NP/DD=+1099
;
; CURRENT week (wfo_orb_may16, 60pt friction, 6% risk WFO):
;   S4 rank 2: Range=90/SL=550/RR=4.0/HTP=0.4   P0=FAIL slope=-85.7%  NP/DD=+1421
;   S5 rank 3: Range=90/SL=550/RR=3.5/HTP=0.4   P0=FAIL slope=-47.7%  NP/DD=+2010
;   S6 rank 4: Range=90/SL=550/RR=3.0/HTP=0.4   P0=FAIL slope=-54.6%  NP/DD=+1555
;
; All swept dims interior to grid -- no boundary truncation on either WFO.
; All 6 streams share Range=90 / Expire=240min -- consistent cross-regime.
; _RiskPct = 1.5 per stream so total when all 6 fire together = 9.0%.
;
; Spread guard: _MaxSpreadPts=60 (Vantage max observed 32pt; SIM_SPREAD_PTS=60 in WFO friction)

